{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并序"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有呪曰：唵弩弩莾哩迦呬帝娑\n婆訶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一俱盧舍乃六里也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此傳言六月，以六月陰六月陽，如莊子六月息\n者也，非謂定指季夏六月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十增減為一中劫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此舊傳文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T27n1545_p0868a15-21"}
